    "statement": "Implement Tasks 4 through 6 from 0_Planning/Multilingual_Local_Model_Speech_Blocks_Plan.md: redesign Speech Blocks prompts for the multilingual source-span contract, update adjacent character/chunking/source/cleanup behavior that affects Speech Blocks quality, and document honest AI settings plus LM Studio/local-model presets without adding unsupported sampler settings.",
